# FWA-CHAT — example environment file.
#
# SECURITY: no secrets belong in this file. The database password is NEVER
# read from the environment — it is entered in the UI at unlock time only.
# Session tokens and ports are generated randomly at every launch.

# Optional: override where the SimpleX binary is looked up.
# Default: runtime/bin/simplex-chat (installed by `npm run setup`).
# FWA_SIMPLEX_BIN=/usr/local/bin/simplex-chat

# Optional: override the profile data directory.
# Default: runtime/profiles/default
# FWA_PROFILE_DIR=

# Optional: do not auto-open the browser at startup (any non-empty value).
# FWA_NO_OPEN=1

# Optional: SOCKS5 proxy for Tor, e.g. 127.0.0.1:9050 (passed to the SimpleX
# core as --socks-proxy; see docs/SIMPLEX_INTEGRATION.md).
# FWA_SOCKS_PROXY=
